OL,3,GNEWSAWoman began own fitness class
OL,4,Aafter feeling like 'token disabled
OL,5,Aperson'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has said she began her own
OL,8,Ffitness business after always feeling
OL,9,Flike the "token disabled person" in
OL,10,Fclasses when she tried to take part.
OL,12,FSam James, from Swindon, Wiltshire, has
OL,13,Fcerebral palsy and has since won a
OL,14,Fnational award for her business.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
