OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1794293817
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman began own fitness class
OL,4,Aafter feeling like 'token disabled
OL,5,Aperson'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer experience is not unique, with
OL,8,FLaura Horton from Disability Rights UK
OL,9,Fsaying many disabled people reported
OL,10,Ffeeling a "little bit burdensome".
OL,11,F"Finding suitable, accessible and
OL,12,Fwelcoming fitness opportunities seems
OL,13,Fto be a reoccurring issue that disabled
OL,14,Fpeople tell us," she said.
OL,16,FSam said there was a "lack of
OL,17,Finformation out there, or a lack of
OL,18,Fawareness of instructors, on how to
OL,19,Finclude disabled people into mainstream
OL,20,Fclasses".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
